  "recoveryPolicyNotes": {
    "central": "Publishes call-class strategy; does not execute host transport retries.",
    "openclaw": "Retry needs an explicit policy admitted by readOnly+idempotent or the governed-entry allowlist. Each request keeps its own timeout; existing policy delays bound attempts.",
    "referenceHost": "Read/prepare classification allows at most three attempts; the five-second recovery deadline starts after the first transient failure.",
    "completedNotReady": "Reference Host continues polling; OpenClaw preserves its current completed notification and stop behavior. Shared eligibility is false in both hosts.",
    "unknownResume": "A dispatched resume with a lost reply retains its local claim; repeated completion events cannot submit it again."
